// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2390811649" "Portal Corporation is reading a very strange temporal disturbances from a nearby dimension. There's no telling what's going on, but I've learned that when something's amuck in the multi-verse, sooner or later it affects Paragon City. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to check out the temporal disturbance.</A> If there's anything amiss, you'll need to rectify the situation."
// AcceptString :
"P156667157" "Check out the temporal disturbance"
// SendOffString :
"P3558660282" "I don't know what you'll face there, {HeroName}. You'd best be prepared."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1067268468" "Stop the temporal disturbance"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P832967692" "You need to deal with that temporal disturbance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4212307745" "The sun bounds across the sky in mere minutes, to be replaced by an equally fleet-footed moon."

