// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P201594224" "While you were dealing with the temporal disturbance, our scientists have analyzed the portals that let all those strange Clockwork robots into Portal Corporation's labs. We think we've found their point of origin: an orbital laboratory on a dimension designated Upsilon Beta 9-6. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to scout out that lab and see what's going on there.</A> We can't afford more attacks like the last one."
// AcceptString :
"P255302346" "Scout out the lab"
// SendOffString :
"P3476544730" "Anything you can find out will help."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3096444809" "Defeat all robots in lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P983914421" "If someone in dimension Upsilon Beta 9-6 is coming after Portal Corporation, I want to know about it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4042539359" "A great energy hums through the floor plates beneath your feet. Everything about this orbital lab is state of the art."

