// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3810327525" "The scanner has a large enough body of data, but you were unable to find any connection between Anti-Matter and Clockwork World."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1835219169" "Well, that mission was a dud, huh, {HeroName}? No confirmed connection between Anti-Matter and Clockwork World. Based on your lack of evidence, and the radiation abilities of Anti-Matter's Clockwork, I'm willing to totally rule out any connection. Anti-Matter is getting his Clockwork troops from somewhere else."
// RandomFameString :
"P1416578442" "{HeroName}'s trying to track down a villain from another dimension!"

