// IntroString :
"P2723608147" "That battle between the Carnival and Anti-Matter's Clockwork was certainly interesting. Could it be that the Carnival is somehow working against Anti-Matter? This inquiring mind wants to know. I've got a lead on a Carnival base I'd like you to check out. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Look for any connection to Anti-Matter's plans, then report back here.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3066898488" "Look for a connection between the Carnival and Anti-Matter"
// SendOffString :
"P2347749185" "We need some answers, {HeroName}. If Anti-Matter's making progress in his efforts to invade this dimension, we need to find out."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2706221006" "Defeat all carnies in warehouse"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P246462643" "We still don't know whether the Carnival is involved in Anti-Matter's plans."

