"P1835013719" "We've had no luck finding a lead on Anti-Matter's plans, {HeroName}, so we're going to have to go back to the source. I'm sending you back to Anti-Matter's home dimension. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to search Anti-Matter's orbital lab for any clue to his next move.</A> Be careful out there, {HeroName}. I get the feeling that Anti-Matter is a cunning enemy, and a determined one. He won't take kindly to another invasion of his lab."
// AcceptString :
"P2907806941" "Search Anti-Matter's orbital lab for any clue to his next move"
// SendOffString :
"P2164232207" "Learn whatever you can, then report back to me."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2547690361" "Defeat Anti-Matter & his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1544404602" "We still don't have much to go on. We need to know more about Anti-Matter!"

