// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4202337187" "You found a disturbing print out."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1865844946" "When anti-Matter disappeared, he left you with a warning."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3655117651" "So, Anti-Matter's trying to coordinate a full-scale invasion of Paragon City. That's bad, {HeroName}; that's very, very bad. We'll just have to find a way to stop him. All I can say is, I'm glad to have you working with me on this."
// RandomFameString :
"P281694925" "{HeroName} sure gets around the multi-verse!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2927973079" "I've received a call for help from Dr. Calvin, the scientist from that world with the wonky time. He says that those strange Clockwork are back, and they're bent on speeding time up once more. You remember what happened last time; everyone on the planet went crazy from the continual shifting between day and night. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to get to Dr. Calvin's world and stop the Clockwork.</A> You're that planet's only hope."
// AcceptString :
"P2708907752" "Stop the Clockwork"
// SendOffString :
"P2857639545" "Calvin says the Clockwork have already replaced several of the devices. You'll have to dismantle them."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P264779603" "Stop robots speeding up time"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4082591266" "Dr. Calvin's dimension is still in jeopardy from the Clockwork."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1278303951" "The ticking and clicking of Clockwork robots can be heard throughout the streets."

