// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Accelerators 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3978429314" "You stopped the Clockwork from distorting this dimension's time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P552278930" "The Clockwork who were trying to accelerate time were silver? Not blue, like Anti-Matter's? I wonder if they're a different faction of his army, or another group altogether? Puzzling, {HeroName}. Quite puzzling indeed."
// RandomFameString :
"P507478165" "Sounds like {HeroName}'s up to the ears in Clockwork."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission9 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1636433432" "Those silver Clockwork seem bound and determined to accelerate the time in Dr. Calvin's dimension. Well, we can't let that continue. The technicians have been trying to trace the Clockwork to their dimension of origin, and they've had some limited success. The silver Clockwork have a hefty dimensional scrambler guarding their lab; so far it's prevented us from figuring out which dimension they're in. But even without that information, we can trace their energy signature and open a portal into their lab. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get to that lab and see if you can link the silver Clockwork to Anti-Matter.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2716558008" "Link the silver Clockwork to Anti-Matter"
// SendOffString :
"P2068320994" "We know Anti-Matter's planning to invade Paragon City. It's absolutely critical that we thwart his plans before they get off the ground."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3965108156" "Investigate Clockwork lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2272740721" "You've got to get your hands on some data about the silver Clockwork!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2668033418" "The cacophony coming from the lab's overhead speakers sounds like it could be music. But its pace is far too rapid to appeal to your ear."

