// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P2874090598" "Do you think Anti-Matter could succeed in taking over this world?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P1317388679" "If he does, Neuron won't be pleased."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - OUT_DOOR_LOC 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3909108572" "Bobcat"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2210826776" "Neuron expects a report on Anti-Matter's progress! He does not forgive failure!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4127119084" "For Neuron!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P236183817" "You defeated Bobcat and her minions."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3072872626" "It sounds to me like those cat people were more of Neuron's minions. In fact, it sounds as if Neuron and Anti-Matter know each other! I'm pretty sure they're not working together on Anti-Matter's plot to invade Paragon City; actually, they sound to me like bitter enemies. I'm not sure of exactly what's going on between them, but one thing is clear: we can't have either one mucking about in Paragon City. We're going to have to deal with this situation head on."
// RandomFameString :
"P884631379" "Did you see those kitty-cat people over in Jamison Office Park? {HeroName} cleared them out."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission11 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3030805836" "Guess what, {HeroName}! Anti-Matter and Neuron come from the same world! It seemed like they knew each other, so I had the technicians take another look at the data from Neuron's dimension. Despite Neuron's dimensional scrambler, we were able to match several distinguishing features with the data from Anti-Matter's dimension. Both villains are from Upsilon-Beta 9-6! Call me crazy, but I think Paragon City got caught in the middle of a power struggle between supervillains. <br><br><A HREF={ACCEPT}>We're sending you to a remote corner of Upsilon Beta 9-6 to plant a network of dimensional scanners.</A> Unfortunately, we can't risk anyone tracing our dimensional signature. You only have an hour to place the scanners."
// AcceptString :
"P1115703285" "Plant dimensional scanners"
// SendOffString :
"P3521857434" "By the way, the techs have come up with a new name for Upsilon Beta 9-6. We're calling it 'Praetorian Earth.'"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1218929853" "I need you to plant those dimensional scanners!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2745777159" "A sudden, shocking roar disrupts the tranquil forest."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - OUT_DOOR_LOC 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2888469689" "Shadowhunter"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2420597969" "No one must enter my domain!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3297123699" "I will track you down like a dog!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2054643934" "Here are the scanners. They feed off bioelectric energy, so you should find some animals to place them on."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2420080222" "You planted the dimensional scanners."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2174921292" "You've been called back to your home dimension."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2410597400" "Those dimensional scanners should let us know if anybody from Praetorian Earth tries to enter our world again. I'm still mighty worried about Anti-Matter's attempt to invade our dimension. It sounds as if he might be getting close to a solution."
// RandomFameString :
"P1938683195" "{HeroName} is a big cheese over at Portal Corporation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2425059464" "Sorry, {HeroName}, but we couldn't risk those villains tracing our dimensional signature. I'll have the scanners placed remotely. The coverage may not be as good, but we'll have to make do."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission12 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4147162398" "{HeroName}, those dimensional scanners just went off! It looks as though a massive force of Praetorians just teleported into a lab here in Paragon City! I need you to get over there on the double, {HeroName}! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>This could be the beginning of Anti-Matter's invasion.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2389486159" "Stop Anti-Matter's invasion"
// SendOffString :
"P477346074" "According to the data, there are overwhelming forces in that lab. I'd take a full team along, if I were you."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2986869367" "Defeat all villains in lab"

